						<div class="fact"><span>Secondary</span><b>AIGC / AI-Assisted Front-End</b></div>
						<div class="fact"><span>Personality</span><b>Confident · Open-minded · Professional</b></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="award-line">
					<span class="tag">AWARD</span>2025 Hubei Vocational College Skills Competition · Digital Art —
					<b>&nbsp;Second Prize&nbsp;</b> ｜ Outstanding Graduate
